{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"items\":[{\"i\":1,\"label\":\"ok\",\"why\":\"H21、H23提供快乐过去后的失去支撑感与身体回落，M43解释紧张先于认知松动的过程；“不再独自承担”在上下文中指身体卸力，没有暗示新增他人回应或关系已经解决。\"},{\"i\":2,\"label\":\"ok\",\"why\":\"H21、H22所确立的失落与充实有限、H6所确立的时间意识，以及M16所描述的暂不追赶，共同支撑注意力暂时不再计算快乐还能持续多久这一局部心理过程，而且明确保留了时间继续流逝的主线。\"},{\"i\":3,\"label\":\"ok\",\"why\":\"H21、H22、H23与M12支撑从失去支撑感到不再把不确定等同于全无、进而体验主观轻盈的局部因果桥；“亲近与失去”概括既有经历，并未新增外部事件，结尾也明确没有消除关系中的不确定性。\"}],\"readable\":\"是\",\"readable_why\":\"三条都完整写出了当下的感受及其心理因果过程，H/M编号和72–77虽是辅助指引，但关键历史与推理已在正文中说明，不依赖听感记录也能理解。 \"}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "2f46d8f2-2dcd-4400-94b9-ab6bb746ff29", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T144246872319Z", "elapsed_seconds": 185.485, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T14:45:52.365261+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e4d2fbb547aca1bca9169ffa5736080c2dc2b605cb02eea47a538b3742400068", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1